{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.1", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-B016", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "compatible_boundary", "prompt": "根据下面两份同主题学习材料，判断脉象时脉位和脉力怎样一起记录？最后归纳为一段统一表述。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-B016-M1", "text": "学习材料甲：脉位可从浮沉等取脉层次描述。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-B016-M2", "text": "学习材料乙：脉力可从有力无力描述，与脉位属于不同维度，应综合记录。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "BA"}
